<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xmlns:mstts="https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts" xml:lang="zh-CN"><voice name="zh-CN-YunxiNeural"><bookmark mark="l0"/><mstts:express-as style="narration-relaxed" styledegree="0.8"><prosody rate="-1%" pitch="0%">常见的放大器，<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">有四个</prosody>。<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">第一</prosody>，拿下游订单更新预测，<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">层层补安全库存</prosody>。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l0-end"/><break time="180ms"/><bookmark mark="l1"/><mstts:express-as style="narration-relaxed" styledegree="0.75"><prosody rate="+1%" pitch="+1%"><prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">第二</prosody>，为了凑运费或起订量，攒到一起下单。<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">第三</prosody>，促销便宜，就<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">提前囤货</prosody>。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l1-end"/><break time="190ms"/><bookmark mark="l2"/><mstts:express-as style="serious" styledegree="0.5"><prosody rate="-1%" pitch="-1%"><prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">第四</prosody>，缺货时按订单比例分配，大家就<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">把需求报大</prosody>。单个企业看似合理，整条链却可能<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">一起失真</prosody>。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l2-end"/></voice></speak>